s replace kitchens in cheap apartments; Buck-A-Slice sells pizza for one eddie a slice; Nicola is the soda. Fresh food is for the wealthy. People pay in eurodollars ('eddies'); Trauma Team sells armed medical response by subscription; NCPD and MaxTac police the rest, when they come. The diner, people and events are invented. Lore comes from the Cyberpunk wiki and in-game texts. The story starts in March 2077; nothing from the game's main plot is staged unless the player asks for it.","living":true,"guide":false,"guideAuto":false,"guideMonth":10},"decision":null,"pitch":null,"heat":{"forces":[],"ops":[],"raids":{},"history":[],"proposal":null,"net":0,"dirty":0,"wash":0,"washedTotal":0},"guestIdx":1,"supplierPool":[{"id":"sp_bio","q":30,"price":1,"reliability":0.97,"terms":"net14","relation":50,"green":false,"monthsWith":40,"key":"bio","name":"Protein wholesaler (Biotechnica licence)","cats":["pantry","produce","dairy","meat","seafood"],"blurb":"SCOP, synthetic eggs and milk, algae noodles and synth-everything from Biotechnica's farms, delivered by drone at 4am."},{"id":"sp_badlands","q":85,"price":1.4,"reliability":0.6,"terms":"cod","relation":62,"green":false,"monthsWith":20,"key":"badlands","name":"A nomad contact","cats":["luxury"],"blurb":"Real eggs and butter from the Badlands, cash on delivery, no questions."}],"suppliers":{"produce":"sp_bio","meat":"sp_bio","seafood":"sp_bio","dairy":"sp_bio","pantry":"sp_bio","luxury":"sp_badlands"},"menu":{"format":"carte","tastingPrice":0,"pairing":false,"pairingPrice":0,"coherence":74,"creBonus":0,"notes":"","v2":1,"identity":"A megabuilding diner: SCOP made edible, synthetic eggs, synth-coffee all night, and real eggs once a week.","dishes":[{"id":"y7wlls6","signature":true,"off":false,"note":"","src":"preset","sec":"food","grade":1,"technique":2,"presentation":1.5,"creativity":30,"name":"SCOP burger","course":"main","desc":"A patty of synthetic protein, seared hard, with pickles and a bun that is mostly real.","cats":{"p